ps://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/commit/4b3d820))\n-   **eslint-plugin:** add prefer-for-of rule ([#&#8203;338](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/issues/338)) ([3e26ab6](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/commit/3e26ab6))\n-   **eslint-plugin:** add prefer-includes rule ([#&#8203;294](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/issues/294)) ([01c4dae](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/commit/01c4dae)), closes [#&#8203;284](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/issues/284)\n-   **eslint-plugin:** add prefer-string-starts-ends-with rule ([#&#8203;289](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/issues/289)) ([5592a2c](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/commit/5592a2c)), closes [#&#8203;285](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/issues/285)\n-   **eslint-plugin:** added new rule await-promise ([#&#8203;192](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/issues/192)) ([5311342](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/commit/5311342))\n-   **eslint-plugin:** added new rule unbound-method ([#&#8203;204](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/issues/204)) ([6718906](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/commit/6718906))\n-   **eslint-plugin:** support type assertions in no-extra-parens rule ([#&#8203;311](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/issues/311)) ([116ca75](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/commit/116ca75))\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Renovate configuration\n\n:date: **Schedule**: \"every weekend\" in timezone Europe/Paris.\n\n:vertical_traffic_light: **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n:recycle: **Rebasing**: Whenever PR is stale, or if you modify the PR title to begin with \"`rebase!`\".\n\n:no_bell: **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about these updates again.\n\n---\n\n - [ ] 